Auto-maintained navigation indexes for the LLM agent. Do not edit manually.
- vault-map.md  — L0: folder counts, tag cloud, recent changes (read first, always)
- catalog.md    — L1: one-line entry per note with summary and links (read for search)
- graph.md      — L2: wikilink graph, outgoing + incoming (read for link traversal)
Rebuilt via "reindex" command. Updated incrementally after every note create/edit.
